# Cloudflare Pages response headers for kiosk.saidans.org.
#
# Keep every page out of search results. Memorial pages are reachable by
# anyone holding a QR code, and that is intended — being findable on Google
# is not.
#
# This is a header rather than a robots.txt Disallow on purpose: a crawler
# blocked from fetching a page never sees its noindex, so a QR URL posted
# somewhere public could still be listed (URL only). Cloudflare's managed
# robots.txt already lets search engines crawl, which is what makes this work.
#
# Well-behaved crawlers only. It does nothing against a scraper; access
# control lives in firestore.rules / storage.rules.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
